      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} This post is intended to make the entire world card a button, to match how it currently functions on live. As seen in the video attached below on the live build, clicking on the world card itself brings up the instance page of the world, giving full world details. This should be the same in the new UI, meaning the rest of the world card behind the join button should also be a button allowing the user to go to the world details.\n\nHope that helps. I use this feature a lot to learn information about a world, such as reading the description or seeing the download size, and in the case it is a large world, I can preload said world, but without this feature, it makes it much more cumbersome to do so.",
